    "whoUses": "Oncologists, thoracic surgeons, and pulmonologists use this code when diagnosing and treating chest cavity cancers. It commonly appears on EOB statements for patients undergoing chemotherapy, radiation therapy, or surgical removal of mediastinal tumors.",
