    "plainEnglish": "This code indicates that you have been diagnosed with cancer (a malignant tumor) that started in the bone or cartilage of your right arm or leg, but the exact bone or cartilage location hasn't been specified in your medical record. Bone cancer in the limbs can affect how the bone functions and may cause pain, swelling, or weakness in that limb. Your doctor will need to do imaging tests like X-rays or MRI scans to pinpoint exactly which bone is affected so they can plan the right treatment.",
