    "plainEnglish": "This code indicates a cancer that has developed in the bones or the smooth cartilage surfaces of joints in your left arm or leg, but the specific bone location hasn't been identified in the medical record. Bone cancer can originate in the bone itself (primary bone cancer) or spread there from elsewhere in the body, and it may cause pain, swelling, or a mass that you can feel under the skin. This is a serious condition that requires oncology treatment.",
