    "whoUses": "Dermatologists, oncologists, and surgical specialists use this code when diagnosing and treating melanoma of the lower limb. It commonly appears on EOB statements for patients undergoing biopsies, surgical removal of skin lesions, imaging studies, or cancer treatment, and is essential for tracking cancer stage and coordinating care across multiple providers.",
