    "whoUses": "Dermatologists, otolaryngologists (ear, nose, and throat specialists), and oncologists use this code when diagnosing and treating ear or external ear canal skin cancers. This code commonly appears on patient EOB statements as it represents a confirmed cancer diagnosis that requires medical intervention.",
