    "whoUses": "Oncologists, ophthalmologists, and ocular oncology specialists use this code when diagnosing and treating eye cancers. It commonly appears on EOB statements for patients undergoing cancer treatment, imaging studies, or consultations related to eye malignancies, though the unspecified nature of the code suggests the medical team should work to identify the specific eye and tumor location for more precise coding.",
