    "plainEnglish": "This code means cancer has spread to one or both kidneys from another part of the body where it originally started. This is called secondary cancer or metastatic cancer—the kidney itself did not develop the cancer first, but cancer cells from elsewhere (like the lungs, colon, or another organ) have traveled there and grown. You may not have any symptoms, or you might experience back pain, blood in urine, or other kidney-related problems.",
