    "whoUses": "Oncologists and hematologists use this code when documenting B-cell lymphoma cases, typically after initial biopsy and imaging studies confirm the diagnosis but before more specific classification. This code commonly appears on EOB statements and medical records for patients undergoing cancer treatment and follow-up care.",
